From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Renato <remourato@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 11:35:41 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat(quick-actions): add Replace only result per action

Each writing action can write its reply back without opening Quick AI.
Quick AI stays the default; Replace only shows the progress pill, and a
failure reports in a HUD.

- Built-in choice stored as raw values in settings, excluded from
  backups; a custom action reads its existing previewsResult flag.
- Replace only refuses to paste into an app that is no longer frontmost
  and copies the reply instead.
- Pages still open Quick AI, since they have no write-back target.
- Reply-end hook now receives the final message, so failures and
  cancellations are reported too.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
